# NT system service table: name number.
# PROVISIONAL numbering generated from the Nt* surface kernel32 uses. The syscall ABI and final numbers
# belong to the kernel (task #12, astra); ntdll's stubs are generated from this file, so changing a number here
# is the only edit needed on the user-mode side.
NtCreateFile 0
NtOpenFile 1
NtReadFile 2
NtWriteFile 3
NtQueryInformationFile 4
NtSetInformationFile 5
NtQueryAttributesFile 6
NtFlushBuffersFile 7
NtClose 8
NtDuplicateObject 9
NtAllocateVirtualMemory 10
NtFreeVirtualMemory 11
NtProtectVirtualMemory 12
NtQueryVirtualMemory 13
NtCreateEvent 14
NtSetEvent 15
NtResetEvent 16
NtCreateMutant 17
NtReleaseMutant 18
NtCreateSemaphore 19
NtReleaseSemaphore 20
NtWaitForSingleObject 21
NtWaitForMultipleObjects 22
NtDelayExecution 23
NtQueryPerformanceCounter 24
NtQuerySystemTime 25
NtTerminateProcess 26
